{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anthill Village</strong> is a cosy, creative strategy game where you build villages for thousands of ant-inspired creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Village Building with a Twist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antlings</strong> have all the strengths of both ants and people! They can craft tools and build villages - while also cooperating on a massive scale thanks to their hive-mind intelligence.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of village-building and tactical gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the land, using all resources you can find to further the colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your ants down many different paths to suit a range of different habitats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research ant-inspired technologies from aphid farming to leaf-cutting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off predatory animals - until you can become the apex predator yourself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the YouTube channel or Discord server to follow along with development.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137880?t=1770717189","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137880?t=1770717189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137880/b0c974fc9919679fd6aeece6bcd5d98d32da7d14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770717189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137880/b0c974fc9919679fd6aeece6bcd5d98d32da7d14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770717189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4043100,"description":""}],"